<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-10-13T07:53:43.104Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 13 Oct 2026 07:53:43 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Bandits killed four soldiers and 18 others in Zamfara and shot an immigration officer in Niger, while gunmen ambushed traders and security operatives in Zamfara, causing civilian casualties. ISWAP fighters attacked a town in Borno but were repelled after air strikes that killed more than 40 militants, including 25 neutralised and 40 fighters reported killed. A Kaduna family was abducted a week ago and bandits are demanding a 300 million naira ransom, prompting Atiku Abubakar to call for their swift rescue. The conflict produced 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMifkFVX3lxTE1HU3RuWFppRXNtbmRBUjFfSTEtOHZuemp2Z2V3aGdvY1A2U2pKMk8xOERPWGdWNWFuRk45Z2xUcUI5eGxBc2FsMDZTbFQtZldTTmdlNGp6MnhfemhVRHFlNktPclNNcVNGbDVlZjM0aTd2NlZZSzRsT2VRRy1Kdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxQczFfSFRPOG5EYXJNQTVMa0p2T0JRMXRXS0Npak1lS0x3RkRXVW1IS0xxZGpQQm9Fb1o4WlZwTWYxZmcyTUpOZnRRN05UWlBlMjY1elM0RHYzcUR4WkRuSFJtSkxVZkxBTmt4cDZoYlNtaGlPR1lZQTRTN1dWMTN3TElYenBPT0Jac3M5MVdZa0tPNlVrZ0t6NVUtZEpNQm_SAaYBQVVfeXFMTThsc2tsczlCTG1VX2ZpbW4yNXFMVFktU21lRUNsaDlNWHhOVGZTRVdJOS1faml2M2tkbS1tcnlsVUM4c2xLMDdsbVYyWVFiUWRyUG5PZGhESEtHbGFKaUl2UEV4QmdDd0NwRGsweGFzZWZCRElnNnh3OEs0bzN5bU45a2JFWmJSZHVUWDdjZVM5ZW12SDNFVzNaMWtwclp2bUN3WXl0UQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilAFBVV95cUxQcENyajBpcG8ydkEzNExNdWY0Z1p2RXA3aXFZd3JtcGtwLU5oa0txdnFQMEphTUkwWW5PX19ldWJvZG1keC0zQzVCeHFXTldnUlJHTUthVFd6Yk1rYUs3WE1xZUZ2clhwX0FUeTlRN3YzbmpvcUlSRDRzdDhfWVN6czFXS19KdVZPempxaERJRGlpUmpD?oc=5&quot;&gt;TheCable&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixAFBVV95cUxNd0RSV295X1NWUDZZekp6TWM4Qm8zZUxuWVdQbVZhMGZ1LUVkNHl0ajdwY3gxdGZNYWlF